  a packing house, issues the invoice for two tonnes of apples its grower delivered,
  and pays the grower. Peppol BIS Billing's R004, R007 and P0112 reject such a file;
  Self-Billing's own rules (plain/peppol-sb-ubl.json) pass it.

  Line 1   2 t x 100.00 = 200.00   S 19%
  VAT 19%                 38.00
  Payable                238.00
-->
